{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.poster.avif?t=1758640062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.webm?t=1758640062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.mp4?t=1758640062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming, atmospheric third\u2011person adventure where you play as a red panda exploring a scenic, tranquil forest.<br>No words, no combat, no rush\u2014just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> \ud83c\udf33 <strong>Atmospheric world</strong> \u2014 Explore a bright and cozy forest filled with natural sounds, soft colors, hidden trails, and unexpected discoveries.<br> \ud83e\udded <strong>Story without words</strong> \u2014 Everything is conveyed through the environment, visual storytelling, and sound. No text \u2014 only emotion and full immersion.<br> \ud83d\udc3c <strong>Panda abilities</strong> \u2014 Climb trees, roll, swim across rivers, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> \u2014 Small, optional tasks gently guide your exploration and unveil new corners of the world.<br> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> \u2014 No pressure, no urgency. Go at your rhythm.<br> \ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> \u2014 A great way to relax and escape into a cozy forest world for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.poster.avif?t=1758640062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.webm?t=1758640062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.mp4?t=1758640062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771270?t=1758640062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/0def3b60d8a10d7af92099ae15cf1ff73260c51d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758640062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/1dd8d78cb16799109d9b6e5a1971cdcbb33f3a53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758640062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/1dd8d78cb16799109d9b6e5a1971cdcbb33f3a53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758640062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4007550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.poster.avif?t=1758640062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/8